    "source": "quantlib",
    "source_detail": "QuantLib 1.43 has no generic cross-currency swap instrument. QuantLib parts: each currency's IborLeg coupons plus SimpleCashFlow notional exchanges, valued by CashFlows.npv on that currency's flat continuous Act/365F discount curve (USD discount 0.04, projection 0.043; EUR discount 0.02, projection 0.023). Generator arithmetic: NPV = USD leg NPV - 1.1 * EUR leg NPV (receive USD 10000000 flat, pay EUR 9000000 -15.0 bp, spot conversion), and dv01 as the 1 bp central difference with all four curves shifted together.",
